{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "c76b104d-463b-4427-ad00-29588ffa21e6",
		"name": "SimpleBank",
		"description": "REST API collection for the SimpleBank Spring Boot project.\n\nStack: Spring Boot 4 / Spring MVC / Spring Security (JWT) / Spring Data JPA / H2.\n\n**Roles**\n- `ADMIN` — full read/write on all resources.\n- `CLIENT` — only own resources.\n\n**Getting started**\n1. Run the app (`mvn spring-boot:run`) — it boots on `http://localhost:8080`.\n2. A bootstrap admin is auto-created on first startup using `application.properties` (`admin@simplebank.local` / `Admin123`).\n3. Call **Auth → Login (admin)** — the test script writes the JWT into the `token` collection variable, and the collection-level Bearer auth picks it up automatically for every other request.\n4. Use **Users → Register user** (ADMIN-only) to create a CLIENT, then **Auth → Login (client)** to switch roles.\n\n**Collection variables**\n- `baseUrl` — defaults to `http://localhost:8080`\n- `adminEmail`, `adminPassword` — match `admin.bootstrap.*` in `application.properties`\n- `clientEmail`, `clientPassword` — for the CLIENT user you register\n- `token` — set automatically by the Login test script\n- `userId`, `accountId`, `targetAccountId`, `cardId` — IDs you fill in (or pass through test scripts) after creating resources",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "21528464"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Auth",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Login (admin)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('200 OK', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
									"var body = pm.response.json();",
									"if (body && body.token) {",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.token);",
									"    console.log('Stored admin JWT in {{token}} (role=' + body.role + ')');",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "noauth"
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"auth",
								"login"
							]
						},
						"description": "Authenticate as the bootstrap admin. Response: `{ token, role }`. The test script writes `token` into the collection variable for subsequent requests."
					},
					"response": []
				},
